  "title": "Cm to feet converter"
 },
 "description": "Convert a height between centimetres and feet/inches. Direction 'cm-to-feet' takes cm and returns feet and inches. Direction 'feet-to-cm' takes feet and inches and returns cm. Source: https://hopi.co.uk/cm-to-feet/",
